    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSuperbly located 1 bedroom apartment\n\nSavills is delighted to introduce No.31 Altus. This apartment offers a beautifully bright second floor one-bedroom home, presented in turnkey condition and enjoying the same refined, contemporary feel associated with the Altus development at Sundays Well.\n\nSet above its own private porch and staircase, the apartment opens into a superb kitchen/living/dining space where floor to ceiling windows capture a full southerly aspect along with an additional east to west sweep of light. From morning through evening, the room is naturally illuminated, framing elevated views towards the cathedral and creating a warm, uplifting atmosphere. The layout is both stylish and practical, with a modern fitted kitchen, generous dining area and a comfortable living zone that makes the most of the outlook. A dedicated utility room, invaluable in apartment living, provides discreet space for laundry and household essentials, enhancing everyday convenience. The bedroom is a calm and inviting retreat, complete with built-in wardrobes and finished to the same high standard as the rest of the home. A well-maintained bathroom completes the accommodation, while a separate plant room offers additional storage. \n\nThe Altus development offers a secure, private and exceptionally well-maintained living environment. Access to the complex is controlled through electronic gated entry, ensuring both privacy and peace of mind for residents. At ground level, a dedicated enclosed car park provides safe and convenient parking, with No.31 benefitting from the use of one allocated space.\n\nNo.31 combines contemporary design, exceptional natural light and a premium setting within one of Cork's most desirable elevated neighbourhoods, offering an ideal home or investment in a sought-after development."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>Superbly located city centre one bedroom apartment</li><li>Approx. 54.6 sq m / 587 sq ft </li><li>High quality finish throughout </li><li>No rental cap</li><li>Own door access </li><li>Secure enclosed parking area, 1 parking space</li><li>Highly efficient heat recovery system </li><li>Walking distance of city centre, UCC, CUH</li><li>Beautifully landscaped outside spaces</ul>"
